{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“Levi-Civita 联络”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Levi-Civita联络"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Riemann 流形的切丛上存在唯一的联络 $\\nabla$, 满足</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\nabla g = 0$ (度量相容性);</li>\n<li>$\\nabla_X Y - \\nabla_Y X - [X,Y]=0$ (无"},{"Local":{"url":"挠","text":"挠率"}},{"Plain":", torsion-free).</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}